WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:03,160
My parents came to stay a few days ago

2
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:04,560
As a result, I got caught in the rain.

3
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:05,760
They didn't bring their ID cards

4
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:06,960
Can we get them together?

5
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:08,360
Valid ID required

6
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:09,760
Work permit driver's license

7
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:11,760
Or other suitable identities can also be used

8
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:13,760
If not, you won’t be able to register today

9
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:17,140
They didn't bring that either, forget it. Thank you.

10
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:19,340
Let others think there are two adults at home

11
00:00:19,340 --> 00:00:22,650
It's better than knowing that it's just me and Mo Mo

12
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:24,050
Go to Yuemue Mall tonight

13
00:00:24,050 --> 00:00:29,720
Supermarket Warehouse Jade Palace

14
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:31,520
As long as it's not completely destroyed by water

15
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:33,320
Whatever can be saved cannot be wasted.

16
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:47,180
Don't look, don't think, move forward

17
00:00:52,410 --> 00:00:54,010
The first floor is too deep. Don’t touch it yet.

18
00:00:54,010 --> 00:00:55,010
Supermarket on the second floor

19
00:00:55,010 --> 00:00:56,210
Jade and Gesture Hall on the first floor

20
00:00:56,210 --> 00:00:57,210
Prioritize these two
